@startuml sequence
title: 用户交互流程图 - 完整数据操作流程
' 展示用户从选择日期到保存数据的完整流程

actor User as U
participant "CapturePage" as CP
participant "DateSelectionFrame" as DSF
participant "InputEnterFrame" as IEF
participant "EditorFrame" as EF
participant "MainCoordinator" as COORD
participant "DataService" as DS
participant "TimeIntegrator" as APP

== 1. 日期选择和数据加载 ==
U -> DSF: 选择日期 "2025-09-05"
activate DSF
DSF -> DSF: _on_calendar_selected()
DSF -> CP: dateSelected信号("2025-09-05")
activate CP
CP -> COORD: 请求该日期的数据
activate COORD
COORD -> DS: get_date_data("2025-09-05")
activate DS
DS -> DS: repository.get_by_date("2025-09-05")
DS -> COORD: 返回 List[ActionUnit]
deactivate DS
COORD -> CP: 返回数据
CP -> DSF: fillData(actionUnits)
DSF -> DSF: 更新列表显示
CP -> EF: fillData(actionUnits[0]) 
note right: 显示第一条记录
deactivate COORD
deactivate CP

== 2. 选择现有记录编辑 ==
U -> DSF: 点击列表中的ActionUnit
DSF -> DSF: _on_list_item_clicked()
DSF -> CP: list_item_selected信号(ActionUnit)
CP -> CP: 设置currentAU = selectedAU
CP -> EF: fillData(selectedAU)
CP -> IEF: fillData(selectedAU)
note right: 同时更新编辑器和输入框
deactivate DSF

== 3. 数据修改 (通过智能输入) ==
ref over U, IEF
    详细输入流程参见:
    Documents/capture/Input_System_Sequence.puml
end ref

IEF -> CP: finalDataSubmitted信号(modifiedActionUnit)
activate CP
CP -> CP: currentAU = modifiedActionUnit

== 4. 保存数据到系统 ==
U -> CP: 点击保存按钮 (或自动保存)
CP -> CP: _on_save_button_clicked()
CP -> APP: saveData_button_clicked信号(currentAU)
activate APP
APP -> COORD: _on_capture_save(currentAU)
COORD -> DS: add_actionUnit(currentAU)
activate DS
DS -> DS: repository.add_action_unit(date, currentAU)
DS -> DS: 自动保存到JSON文件
DS -> COORD: actionUnit_added信号(currentAU)
DS -> APP: 通知数据已保存
deactivate DS
APP -> APP: 更新应用状态
deactivate APP

== 5. UI状态更新 ==
COORD -> CP: 通知保存成功
CP -> DSF: 刷新显示数据
CP -> EF: 显示成功状态
deactivate CP

== 6. 创建新记录流程 ==
U -> EF: 点击"新建"按钮
EF -> CP: new_button_selected信号
CP -> CP: currentAU = createNewActionUnit()
CP -> EF: fillData(newActionUnit)
CP -> IEF: fillData(newActionUnit)
note right: 清空表单，准备新输入

== 7. 删除记录流程 ==
U -> EF: 点击"删除"按钮
EF -> CP: delete_button_clicked信号(currentAU)
CP -> APP: 请求删除确认
APP -> COORD: _on_capture_delete(currentAU)
COORD -> DS: delete_actionUnit(currentAU.id)
DS -> DS: repository.delete(currentAU.id)
COORD -> CP: 通知删除完成
CP -> DSF: 刷新列表，移除已删除项
CP -> EF: 清空编辑器或显示下一条记录

@enduml